ch NA-84 view"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01YJddQZ8waJqbSXDQST1fwB","tool_input":{"command":"rtk curl -sL --max-time 20 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/payloadcms/payload/main/templates/website/src/collections/Posts/index.ts | tail -60; echo \"=== SLUG FIELD ===\"; rtk curl -sL --max-time 20 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/payloadcms/payload/main/templates/website/src/fields/slug/index.ts","description":"Fetch upstream website template Posts and slug field"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01F3gnZ7fUUyZKLsP9dC8mXL","tool_input":{"command":"rtk curl -sL --max-time 20 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/payloadcms/payload/main/templates/website/src/fields/slug/index.ts","description":"Fetch upstream slug field helper"}},{"tool_name":"Skill","tool_use_id":"toolu_01T2ySNXznDFRcn1GUsBX31K","tool_input":{"skill":"loop","args":"/sdlc:loop https://github.com/whimzyLive/nightshift-ai/pull/200 --phase spec --on-clean \"bash /Users/Rushi/.claude/plugins/cache/nightshift/sdlc/0.45.4/scripts/auto-merge-pr.sh https://github.com/whimzyLive/nightshift-ai/pull/200\""}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_015bk86EB3g6AULCb7DoqgML","tool_input":{"command":"BUDGET_FILE=\"./.tmp/756ed0b8-24c3-495f-a29d-7bb22757a86b/loop-budget\"; if [ ! -f \"$BUDGET_FILE\" ]; then printf '%s 0 - -\\n' \"$(date +%s)\" > \"$BUDGET_FILE\"; fi; rtk read \"$BUDGET_FILE\"","description":"Initialize loop budget file"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01SAFZGUEcM4PEhHeb9XnD76","tool_input":{"command":"printf '%s\\n' \"loop-status: pass=1 head=0b93d91d reviewed-head=0 review-clean=- unresolved=0 checks-pending=0 checks-failing=0\" | tee ./.tmp/756ed0b8-24c3-495f-a29d-7bb22757a86b/loop-status-last","description":"Persist loop status line"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_012jrxBfGbVgpKac7C8w7snE","tool_input":{"command":"rtk gh pr diff 200 > ./.tmp/756ed0b8-24c3-495f-a29d-7bb22757a86b/pr200.diff; rtk wc -l ./.tmp/756ed0b8-24c3-495f-a29d-7bb22757a86b/pr200.diff","description":"Fetch PR 200 diff to file"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_015wpmh16isjetEnUMih6QWh","tool_input":{"command":"gh api repos/whimzyLive/nightshift-ai/pulls/200/reviews --method POST --input ./.tmp/756ed0b8-24c3-495f-a29d-7bb22757a86b/review.json --jq '.id, .state, (.body | length)'","description":"Post inline review on PR 200"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01GGtia69PxBhMEU8FMsqLWx","tool_input":{"command":"rm -f .tmp-na84-fixes.py; F=docs/superpowers/specs/NA-84.md; echo \"=== id: string ===\"; rtk grep -n \"id: string\" $F; echo \"=== revalidateDelete ===\"; rtk grep -n \"revalidateDelete\" $F; echo \"=== beforeChange ===\"; rtk grep -n \"beforeChange\" $F; echo \"=== skipPopulateAuthors ===\"; rtk grep -n \"skipPopulateAuthors\" $F; echo \"=== isActiveLink ===\"; rtk grep -n \"isActiveLink\" $F; echo \"=== decisions ===\"; rtk grep -n \"^\\*\\*D[0-9]\" $F","description":"Verify edits landed consistently"}},{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_use_id":"toolu_01JeNVAeThu4jNYokSbNRZV5","tool_input":{"command":"rtk prettier --check docs/superpowers/specs/NA-84.md 2>&1 | tail -5","description":"Check prettier formatting of the spec"}}],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"## `/auto NA-84` — Phase 1 (Spec) complete\n\n**Routing.** Issue type `Story` → single-story flow. Scrum-master auto-assess returned `QUALITY=ok`, `STORY_POINTS=8`. Inline triage (`refs/triage.md`, `ITYPE=story`, threshold `T=3`): `WORK_KIND=feature`, `TRIAGE=full` → **Workflow A**. No spec on `develop` → **Phase 1**.\n\n**Spec PR:** https://github.com/whimzyLive/nightshift-ai/pull/200 — `docs/superpowers/specs/NA-84.md`, 517 lines.\n\n**Review cycle** (repo config: `Review agent=claude-inline`, `Review mode=on-create`, no review gate → in-session review path). Five findings, all re-verified against the repo and accepted, fixed in `7a89f2b`, every thread replied to and resolved:\n\n| Finding | Verified against |\n|---|---|\n| `revalidateDelete` referenced with no defining file row | file table declared only `revalidatePost.ts` |\n| `publishedAt` `beforeChange` had no registration site | collection `hooks` bullet omitted it entirely |\n| `id: string` contradicts the repo's id type | `payload-types.ts` declares `id: number` ×8 (postgres); `faq.ts` uses `id: Faq['id']` |\n| `populateAuthors` `afterRead` is an N+1 at build | `getPublishedPostSlugs()` is `limit: 500, depth: 0`, uses only `slug` |\n| Nav entry won't highlight on `/blog/<slug>` | `nav-bar.tsx:25` `isActiveLink` is exact-match |\n\nThe spec also caught a genuine draft-leak risk on its own: Payload's Local API defaults to `overrideAccess: true`, so the ticket's claim that `authenticatedOrPublished` needs \"no bespoke filtering\" was wrong for the frontend readers.\n\n**Two things to know:**\n\n1. **The PR was not auto-merged, despite `AI Workflow = Full Auto`.** This repo's `Review mode` is `on-create`, which caps the cycle at one review + one fix and stops without re-reviewing. The auto-merge hook only fires on the loop's verified-clean exit, which `on-create` never reaches once the review finds something. PR #200 is open, clean, and waiting for a human merge — this is the specified behaviour, not a failure. To get hands-free merging on this path, the repo would need `Review mode: on-update`.\n\n2. **Branch name deviated.** The worktree's bench guard denies pushes outside `bench/**`, so the spec landed on `bench/NA-84/spec` rather than `spec/NA-84`. The PR body records this. It does not affect resumption — Phase 2 keys off the spec file existing on `develop`, not the branch name.\n\n**Quality gate could not run:** `pnpm nx run-many -t test` fails with `Could not find \".modules.yaml\"` because this bench worktree has no `node_modules`. Environmental and pre-existing; the change is a single Markdown file. CI on the PR is the authoritative signal.\n\n**Next:** merge PR #200 to `develop`, then re-run `/auto NA-84` — Phase 2 will generate the plan and implementation on one branch as a single PR.","ttft_ms":2416,"ttft_stream_ms":1426,"time_to_request_ms":237,"type":"result","duration_ms":1642493,"uuid":"c57f3256-2258-4261-9394-34a78bd56f74"}
